01:19:00.000 --> 01:19:01.500
Come on, let's say hello to them.

01:19:02.320 --> 01:19:03.070
Let's eat.

01:19:03.450 --> 01:19:27.180
Let me say hello to you.

01:20:30.320 --> 01:20:31.060
Yeah!

01:20:31.980 --> 01:20:32.160
Come on!

01:21:30.920 --> 01:21:31.220
Yes, sir!

01:22:23.680 --> 01:22:27.700
Fatty, Shi Huo, you're unlucky.

01:23:01.948 --> 01:23:02.448
Wait!

01:24:01.020 --> 01:24:03.330
Master, are you all right?

01:24:03.430 --> 01:24:04.210
I'm fine.

01:24:05.790 --> 01:24:06.190
Master.

01:24:07.110 --> 01:24:10.120
You are not his opponent. Go away.

01:24:10.320 --> 01:24:10.500
Master.

01:24:31.308 --> 01:24:31.808
Ha!

01:25:06.750 --> 01:25:06.890
Yeah.

01:25:30.000 --> 01:25:32.540
You don't have the guts to fight now, do you?

01:25:36.910 --> 01:25:39.330
This is what you call a man of his word.

01:25:41.660 --> 01:25:43.140
You're better than me.

01:25:43.460 --> 01:25:44.250
Take this!

01:25:50.350 --> 01:25:55.970
I'll kill you!

01:26:07.190 --> 01:26:11.450
Right punch, left punch, right punch, left punch, left punch, right punch, left punch.

01:26:11.510 --> 01:26:12.230
An instant blow!

01:26:14.790 --> 01:26:15.790
Where's the flipper?

01:26:16.550 --> 01:26:20.720
It fell on the ground.

01:26:42.250 --> 01:26:52.790
My name is Xuxi Shishi.

01:26:55.760 --> 01:26:58.290
This is called real talent.

01:27:03.780 --> 01:27:09.800
What are you shouting for?

01:27:10.360 --> 01:27:11.300
I'm just looking back.

01:27:18.500 --> 01:27:21.360
You're still in position.

01:27:22.270 --> 01:27:23.430
This is the trend now.

01:27:27.380 --> 01:27:27.860
Master.

01:27:31.084 --> 01:27:31.924
Huh?

01:28:12.796 --> 01:28:14.556
Don't you have the guts now?

01:28:14.684 --> 01:28:17.684
Subtitles by the Amara.org community

01:28:21.436 --> 01:28:22.276
Master!

01:28:23.068 --> 01:28:24.768
You're really dead.

01:28:25.052 --> 01:28:27.292
You taught me and beat me in my life.

01:28:27.452 --> 01:28:29.292
I'm scared of you and I hate you.

01:28:30.030 --> 01:28:32.990
Now you're dead. I miss you so much.

01:28:34.540 --> 01:28:38.530
I want to learn your kung fu and beat you.

01:28:38.890 --> 01:28:41.860
But now I don't have a chance.
